      "player": "GLM47 Stoic",
      "decision_index": 25,
    },
    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Left one Stadium Headliner back when the opponent had no creatures to block and only 1 untapped Island. Attacking with all 3 creatures would have generated an additional Mobilize token and dealt more damage (5 instead of ~3-4) with zero risk.",
      "action_taken": "Attacked with only 2 creatures (one Stadium Headliner + Slickshot Show-Off), holding one Stadium Headliner back.",
      "better_line": "Choose 'All attack' to send all 3 creatures, generating 2 Mobilize tokens and maximizing damage against an empty board. With pump spells in hand and Leyline of Resonance's copy effect, more attackers means more potential damage.",
      "type": "blunder",
      "snapshot_index": 44,
