      "decision_index": 26,
    },
    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Dreadmaw's Ire gives +2/+2 and trample to an attacking creature, but the trample is largely irrelevant on a flying Slickshot Show-Off, and the artifact destruction trigger is useless against an opponent with no artifacts. Full Bore would have given +3/+2 (1 more damage), and Might of the Meek would have drawn a card while still triggering prowess, which is more valuable than 2 extra damage when opponent is at 15 life.",
      "action_taken": "Cast Dreadmaw's Ire for +2/+2 and irrelevant trample/artifact destruction",
