      "decision_index": 27,
    },
    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Cast Turn Inside Out targeting Slickshot Show-Off during precombat main instead of during combat. While lethal is available either way (Slickshot + 2 Headliners + 2 tokens = enough damage), casting pump spells before combat gives the opponent more information and a window to respond before attackers are declared. With only 1 untapped Island the risk is small, but it's still strictly worse sequencing.",
      "action_taken": "Cast Turn Inside Out on Slickshot Show-Off during precombat main phase",
