    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Redirect Lightning was cast unnecessarily on the stack targeting their own Turn Inside Out, wasting a card (and likely 5 life or 2 mana). GLM47 already had lethal damage available: Slickshot Show-Off (1/2 flying haste) + Turn Inside Out (+3/+0, triggers +2/+0) = 6 power, plus Full Bore (+3/+2, triggers +2/+0) = 11 power flying, which is lethal against 8 life. The extra spell was completely unnecessary.",
      "action_taken": "Cast Redirect Lightning (paying 5 life or {2}) to redirect their own Turn Inside Out, wasting a card for an unnecessary Slickshot trigger.",
