    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Redirected Turn Inside Out (+3/+0) to Stadium Headliner instead of Slickshot Show-Off. Slickshot Show-Off has flying (harder to block) and already benefits from noncreature spell triggers (+2/+0 each). With the opponent at 8 life, maximizing damage on the evasive flyer would be more effective for pushing lethal damage.",
      "action_taken": "Targeted Stadium Headliner with Turn Inside Out's +3/+0 buff",
